\f1\b \cf0 Time Zones
\f0\b0 \
\
The time zone is UTC, just like it is for Little Golem.\
\
\

\f1\b What if I forget my password?
\f0\b0 \
\
Since I don't keep anyone's e-mail address, and the password is stored in encrypted format, there is really no way for me to recover your password. The only secure thing is to... remember your password!\
\
\

\f1\b About JTwixt
\f0\b0 \
\
There is a "Download JTwixt file" link under every game board. JTwixt is a separate Java program that you can use to analyze board positions. It is much more powerful for analyzing Twixt game trees and keeping notes about branches. \
\
\

\f1\b Who's behind this site?
\f0\b0 \
\
This site is a personal project of Alan Hensel, originally made for the purposes of learning Ruby on Rails. You can reach me at alhensel@gmail.com.\
